-worktree isolation, a durable session registry, a stacking window manager, stage handoffs, runnable deliverable previews (hard-guarded off port 8777), and Ghost World Labs branding.\n  - **v4 \"Project Cockpit\"** (built 2026-06-13, 9 waves GREEN, 637 tests passing) â€” one terminal substrate with skill auto-load-once/greet-once (fixing the repeating-prompt bug), a claudeâ†”gemini engine toggle with per-project persistence, inline expanding lane panels with status lights, per-lane doc roles, project cost/tokens/time rollups, grass-idea promotion, and type-aware deliverable launch.\n\n- **Branding/positioning:** presented as a **Ghost World Labs** tool, \"Powered by NextGen Nuclear â˜¢,\" serving one user (J.C. Liechty) across domains of academic, commercial, family, and writing work.\n\n*(All claims above are grounded in the project's `CLAUDE.md` and frozen planning docs; I summarized from that context rather than re-reading source files.)*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":45292,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fd597e6a-308a-4be1-968a-f0b061f0246c","uuid":"5f984fcb-1fe0-41a1-b383-21626e6ad5e7","request_id":"req_011Cc1JMHZA29g5FXyHSLa8Z"}
